{"total_count":4,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5881","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5881/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5881/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5881/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5881","id":5706639229,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABGowKCg","number":5881,"title":"[field] Don't warn when an uncontrolled FieldControl's defaultValue changes","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6619596510,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio8G3g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/type:%20bug","name":"type: bug","color":"e11d21","default":false,"description":"It doesn't behave as expected.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7205061925,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABrXSFJQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20field","name":"component: field","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the field component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-10-05T04:54:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T05:18:46Z","closed_at":"2026-10-06T05:18:46Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/5881","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5881","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5881.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5881.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-06T05:18:46Z"},"body":"Fixes #5880\n\n`Field.Control` passed `defaultValue` to `useControlled`, which warns when the default changes after mount. The hook's stored value was only read for controlled fields, though. Uncontrolled fields already forward the current `defaultValue` to the native input, so a changing default works the same as on a plain `<input>`, and the warning was wrong.\n\n## Changes\n\n- This PR removes `useControlled` from `FieldControl`. Its only other job was the controlled ↔ uncontrolled switch warning, which React DOM already logs because we pass either `value` or `defaultValue` to the input.\n- This PR also re-syncs `data-filled` when `defaultValue` changes. Before the user types, React updates the input's value along with the default, but the filled state stayed stale.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5881/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5881/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5623","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5623/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5623/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5623/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5623","id":5331989007,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABB_yTaQ","number":5623,"title":"[field] Keep pending validation when a control is disabled","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6619597495,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio8Ktw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/type:%20regression","name":"type: regression","color":"990414","default":false,"description":"A bug, but worse, it used to behave as expected.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7205061925,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABrXSFJQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20field","name":"component: field","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the field component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8739210703,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAACCOXFzw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/internal","name":"internal","color":"098087","default":false,"description":"Behind-the-scenes enhancement. Formerly called “core”.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-09-03T03:49:53Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T07:39:14Z","closed_at":"2026-09-10T07:38:18Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/5623","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5623","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5623.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5623.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Regression from #5449.\n\nDisabling a field (`Field.Root`, `Field.Control`, or `Fieldset` `disabled`) unregisters its control, and since #5449 that unregister path cancelled any in-flight async `validate` result or pending debounced commit. A field disabled while a server check was pending came back neutral, and the error never showed until the next edit or submit. In 1.7.0 the pending result still published and appeared once the field was re-enabled.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Disabling now only removes the form registration. The control keeps source ownership and its pending validation, which publishes as before.\n- Only the control's unmount cleanup passes the new `unmounted` flag, which clears ownership and cancels pending work. Replacement by a different control still cancels through the existing ownership-transfer branch.\n- Keeping ownership while disabled matters: a disabled control that is later unmounted or swapped can still identify itself and drop its stale result, so it cannot land on the replacement control.\n- Added regression tests for both sequences: disabled-then-re-enabled publishes the result, and disabled-then-replaced drops it.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5623/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5623/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5563","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5563/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5563/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5563/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5563","id":5242614307,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABA5Pcyg","number":5563,"title":"[field][checkbox][switch] Fix controlled blur validation and stale filled state","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6619568071,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio6Xxw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20switch","name":"component: switch","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the switch component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6619596510,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio8G3g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/type:%20bug","name":"type: bug","color":"e11d21","default":false,"description":"It doesn't behave as expected.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6619647145,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio_MqQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20checkbox","name":"component: checkbox","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the checkbox component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7205061925,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABrXSFJQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20field","name":"component: field","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the field component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-08-25T06:04:50Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T08:56:46Z","closed_at":"2026-08-25T08:47:42Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/5563","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5563","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5563.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5563.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-25T08:47:41Z"},"body":"Two field lifecycle fixes. The blur half is a regression from #5460; the filled half predates it.\n\n- **Controlled blur normalization no longer discards validation.** With `validationMode=\"onBlur\"`, a blur handler that normalizes the controlled value (e.g. `.trim()`) had its commit retired by the value's prop transition. The blur handler now re-commits the settled DOM value in a microtask, unless it settled back to the initial value (a programmatic reset stays quiet). Async normalization after blur is still not covered.\n- **`filled` is now derived from the current value** in a layout effect (the `NumberField` pattern) instead of transition callbacks and write-only mount effects. This fixes stale `data-filled` on remounts and custom `render` elements in `Field.Control`, `Checkbox.Root`, and `Switch.Root`, and `CheckboxGroup` now fully owns the filled state.\n\n`dirty` stays transition-driven: deriving it needs mount-time `initialValue` ordering guarantees and interacts with #5345.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5563/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5563/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5526","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5526/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5526/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5526/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5526","id":5179740562,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABAHhRWg","number":5526,"title":"[internal] Improve state initialization and add tests for React 17 fallback","user":{"login":"sai6855","id":60743144,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNzQzMTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60743144?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sai6855","html_url":"https://github.com/sai6855","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sai6855/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sai6855/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sai6855/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sai6855/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sai6855/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sai6855/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sai6855/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sai6855/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sai6855/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6619596510,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio8G3g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/type:%20bug","name":"type: bug","color":"e11d21","default":false,"description":"It doesn't behave as expected.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8739210703,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAACCOXFzw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/internal","name":"internal","color":"098087","default":false,"description":"Behind-the-scenes enhancement. Formerly called “core”.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":16,"created_at":"2026-08-18T08:24:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T07:44:08Z","closed_at":"2026-10-06T07:44:08Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/5526","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5526","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5526.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5526.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-06T07:44:08Z"},"body":"Issue described in https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5462#issuecomment-5313700120 is actually not specific to `TabsPanel`, it is a global issue. hence fixed in `useId` instead of patching as suggested by `codex review`.\r\n\r\n## Issue\r\n\r\nOn React 17, a component that mounted with an `id` prop kept that id forever, removing the prop never fell back to a generated one, because the fallback stored the caller's id in the slot meant for generated ids. Also switches `||` to `??` so an empty-string `id` is respected.\r\n\r\nNew `useId.react17.test.tsx` forces the fallback branch (mocks `SafeReact.useId` to `undefined`), which nothing tested before since the repo runs React 19 and CI's oldest job is React 18.\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5526/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5526/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}